                <pb facs="0480" n="362" sameAs="frus:frus1928v02/pg362"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">125.643/61: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >MacMurray</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-10-30T20:00:00+08:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 30,
                                1928—8 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received October 30—11
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>801. Your telegram No. 359, October 26, 4 p.m. I am hopeful that the matter can
                    be arranged in the near future.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">MacMurray</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
